# $BUNDLE/.gofer/<n> for every runtime-populated 9p gofer EmptyDir/subPath mount
# the freeze warm-copied. These MUST win over the bsrc[d] live-source branch
# below: Pod B's live source for such a destination is the FRESH EMPTY kubelet
# dir, whose 9p walk for a runtime subtree (e.g. ~/.claude/projects) would ENOENT
# -> agent sub rc=128. Repointing to the warm copy carries that subtree across C/R.
import os as _os
def _atomic_overlay(path,data):
